# ---- generated project screenshots ----
# npm run shots (scripts/screenshots) writes WebP captures here from each
# project's live URL. These ARE committed (not ignored): most deploy
# platforms (Vercel, Netlify, etc.) build straight from the pushed repo,
# so anything not committed simply isn't there on the live site — and
# running Puppeteer as a build step is slow/flaky on most build
# environments anyway. Re-run `npm run shots` locally and commit the
# updated files whenever a project's live site changes enough to warrant
# a fresh screenshot.
